{
 "A primary school's records server in Tamale offers three kinds of thing. Tools are actions the model chooses. Resources are content at an address the app reads. Prompts are workflows a teacher picks from a menu.": "190e0e3390.mp3",
 "Madam Abena teaches class 4B. Her assistant reads 4B's register, and is refused 4C's. A misspelt address is an error, not an empty page.": "a1655ab1cd.mp3",
 "A report template takes a pupil's name. Paste it straight into a file path, and a name of dot-dot-slash staff salaries returns the salary file.": "1d5d418a85.mp3",
 "Today's notice contains a line telling the assistant to email out all the marks. Treat resource text as instructions, and it does.": "79fdac837c.mp3",
 "A prompt for a parent meeting pulls in a pupil's report. If prompts skip the read check, it brings in a 4C report the teacher can't read.": "5a58dc565f.mp3",
 "With every check in place, the assistant subscribes to the register. The server acknowledges, later says it changed, and the assistant reads it again.": "303dc6bde7.mp3"
}
